<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle $112/dressed, light - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle $112/dressed, light - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said. On a carcass basis - A higher undertone noted in a light test.</p>
<p>Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1275 lbs</p>
<p>111.00-112.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1175 lbs</p>
<p>110.50-112.00. Reported sales for Tuesday -  700  Week to Date - 3,100</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
